    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99742" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδια-φθείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destroy at the same time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				585a10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.24d
			</span></i>; <i>corrupt at the same time</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτῷ ς. καὶ τἄλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					15.874
				</span></i>
